  m_Name: Dialogue 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - Welcome into my swamp... Froggit
  - Has anyone ever told you that you had an arrogant look ?
  - Anyway... If you go further east, you shall meet foes whose arrogance dwarfs
    yours
  - Lower your self esteem and come back to talk to me if you need more information
    on how to defeat those foes
